---
layout: base.njk
pagination:
  data: levies
  size: 1
  alias: levy
permalink: "/levies/issue-{{ levy.issue_number }}/"
eleventyComputed:
  title: "{{ ('Ashtabula County Issue ' + (levy.issue_number | string) + ' Levy — ' + levy.jurisdiction) | safe }}"
  description: "{{ ('Issue ' + (levy.issue_number | string) + ' asks voters in ' + levy.jurisdiction + ' about ' + (levy.purpose | lower) + '. Review the levy type, millage, term, tax change, and official sources for the November 3, 2026 ballot.') | safe }}"
---

<article class="levy-profile">
  <p class="directory-meta"><a href="{{ '/levies/' | url }}">Ashtabula County property tax levies</a> · Issue {{ levy.issue_number }}</p>
  <h1>Issue {{ levy.issue_number }}: {{ levy.jurisdiction }}</h1>
  <p>{{ levy.purpose }}</p>
  <span class="verification-badge">Rates, levy type, term, and annual revenue checked {{ levy.verification_date }} against the county estimator and official ballot</span>
  <dl class="levy-facts">
    <dt>Jurisdiction</dt><dd>{{ levy.jurisdiction }}</dd>
    <dt>Purpose</dt><dd>{{ levy.purpose }}</dd>
    <dt>Type</dt><dd>{{ levy.type | replace("_", " ") | capitalize }}{% if levy.tax_change %} · changes the tax{% else %} · straight renewal{% endif %}</dd>
    <dt>Tax rate</dt><dd><strong>{{ levy.millage }} {% if levy.millage == 1 %}mill{% else %}mills{% endif %}</strong>. A mill is $1 for every $1,000 of taxable value. Ohio taxes homes at 35% of appraised market value, so one mill is about $35 per year for each $100,000 of home value before reductions.</dd>
    {% if levy.term_years %}<dt>Term</dt><dd>{{ levy.term_years }} years</dd>{% endif %}
    <dt>Election</dt><dd>November 3, 2026 · Ashtabula County, Ohio</dd>
  </dl>
  <section class="levy-personal-impact" aria-labelledby="levy-impact-heading" data-levy-estimator>
    <p class="content-eyebrow">Plain-language impact</p>
    <h2 id="levy-impact-heading">What could this mean for your property?</h2>
    {% if levy.type == "additional" %}<p>This is a new tax. If approved, it adds the proposed rate to properties in this district for {{ levy.term_years }} years. If it fails, this new levy is not added.</p>
    {% elif levy.type == "renewal_increase" %}<p>This renews the current tax and adds <strong>{{ levy.millage - levy.existing_millage }} mills</strong>. The added portion is the estimated increase; the full {{ levy.millage }}-mill rate is the renewed levy total. If it fails, the existing tax expires.</p>
    {% elif levy.type == "renewal_reduction" %}<p>This renews the current tax at a lower rate, from {{ levy.existing_millage }} to {{ levy.millage }} mills. The reduction is the estimated savings. If it fails, the existing tax expires.</p>
    {% else %}<p>This is a straight renewal. It does not add a new tax or increase the rate; it continues the existing tax for {{ levy.term_years }} years. If it fails, the current levy expires.</p>{% endif %}
    {% if levy.notes %}<p class="levy-district-note"><strong>For the district:</strong> {{ levy.notes }}</p>{% endif %}
    <div class="levy-estimator levy-estimator-single">
      <label class="levy-value-field" for="levy-home-value">Your home’s appraised market value
        <span class="levy-value-input-wrap"><span aria-hidden="true">$</span><input id="levy-home-value" data-levy-home-value type="number" min="1" step="1000" value="100000" inputmode="decimal" aria-describedby="levy-estimator-help"></span>
      </label>
      <div class="levy-personal-estimate" data-levy-estimate data-kind="{{ levy.type }}" data-rate="{{ levy.millage }}" data-existing-rate="{{ levy.existing_millage or 0 }}" aria-label="Estimated individual tax impact">
        {% if levy.type == "additional" %}At $100,000 appraised value: about ${{ (levy.millage * 35) | round(2) }} a year in new tax before reductions.
        {% elif levy.type == "renewal_increase" %}At $100,000 appraised value: about ${{ ((levy.millage - levy.existing_millage) * 35) | round(2) }} a year added; about ${{ (levy.millage * 35) | round(2) }} total for this levy before reductions.
        {% elif levy.type == "renewal_reduction" %}At $100,000 appraised value: about ${{ ((levy.existing_millage - levy.millage) * 35) | round(2) }} a year in savings; about ${{ (levy.millage * 35) | round(2) }} total for this levy before reductions.
        {% else %}At $100,000 appraised value: about ${{ (levy.millage * 35) | round(2) }} a year for this existing levy before reductions; this is not a new charge.{% endif %}
      </div>
      <p class="levy-estimator-help" id="levy-estimator-help">The $100,000 starting value is only an example. This rough estimate multiplies the full voted rate by 35% of appraised value. It does not account for parcel-specific effective rates, credits, rollbacks, or other reductions, and is not a tax bill. <a href="https://auditor.ashtabulacounty.gov/dnn/Real-Estate/Levy-Calculator" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Check the County Auditor’s levy estimator</a> for your parcel; the county says its estimate also excludes rollbacks and reductions.</p>
      <p class="levy-estimator-status" data-levy-estimator-status aria-live="polite">Example uses a $100,000 appraised value.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <p class="worksheet-guide-cta"><a class="primary-action" href="{{ ('/worksheet/?item=levy-' + levy.issue_number) | url }}">Review this levy step by step <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></p>
  {% if levy.sources and levy.sources.length %}<section class="source-list"><h2>Official and research sources</h2><ul>{% for source in levy.sources %}<li><a href="{{ source.url }}" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">{{ source.label }}</a></li>{% endfor %}</ul></section>{% endif %}
  <p><a href="{{ '/sample-ballots/' | url }}">Check your official precinct ballot</a> · <a href="{{ '/levies/' | url }}">All property tax levies</a> · <a href="{{ '/worksheet/' | url }}">My worksheet</a></p>
</article>
<script src="{{ '/js/levy-estimator.js' | url }}?v=20261011-2" defer></script>

